{t: "Task A \u2014 Write a 1-page outline", d: "Structure 1-2-3-2-1-1: write 1\u20132 sentences per block for your capstone thesis. \u22641 page total."},
{t: "Task B \u2014 Record a 10-minute voice note", d: "1 full take, no editing. Check: 130\u2013150 words/min, 2-second pauses between blocks, rounded numbers, zero fillers."},
{t: "Task C \u2014 Ask to be 'attacked'", d: "Present to a friend/AI using the 15-question bank. Grade with the rubric: target total \u226512 with no score of 1."}
